================================================================================
NOTE on third-party content
================================================================================
NasGameHub is a metadata-management tool. It does NOT bundle any commercial ROMs,
game cover art, or game descriptions. All scraped metadata is fetched at runtime
from third-party services (ScreenScraper.fr, OpenAI-compatible APIs, 115 cloud
disk). Users are responsible for ensuring they have the legal right to download
and own the ROMs they place in `data/roms/`.

The bundled LibRetro database files in `data/libretro_db/` are derived from
publicly available metadata (https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database) and
contain only factual fields (year, region, publisher).